== Welcome to the [[P2P Foundation: About | P2P Foundation Wiki]], $1! ==
Your new account has been created.  

====Please confirm your email address====

Before you can edit pages on the wiki you will need to confirm your email address.  

Check your email for a message from '''webmaster@p2pfoundation.net'''

If you need to correct your email address or have the confirmation link resent you can do so from your [[Special:Preferences|{{SITENAME}} preferences]] under "'Email."'

====Review your preferences====

You can use your [[Special:Preferences|{{SITENAME}} preferences]] to configure your notification settings from the site.

It is highly recommended that you review your preferences in order to adjust the default settings for email notification.

By default you will be notified of changes to pages you edit, create, move, or delete.

Usually this is a good thing because it is assumed you wish to keep an eye on this pages.  If it is not, though, you can always visit your preferences to adjust the settings.

====Contact us====

If you run into any problems, please feel free to [[P2P Foundation:Administrators | contact us]].  Also, there's an extensive collection of [[:Category:P2P Foundation Wiki How-To | how-to]] documents that might come in handy if you are new to wiki's or have other questions about how the site works.

You can come back to this page any time by typing "[[Welcome]]" into the search, or type it in after the .net/ in the address bar.

Welcome!

The P2P Foundation Maintainers
